WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.660
Hello everybody! My name is Markiplier! And welcome to Those Nights at Rachel's.

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:07.280
Now this is made by the same guy that made... The Joy of Creation.

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:08.520
So you know it's probably going to be good.

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:11.760
And this was also made in the Unreal engine, so I don't know if it's going to be fully-

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:13.040
(Phone call) "Hello, and welcome to your new job-"

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:13.720
Hiii!

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:14.500
"at Doug's and Rachel's."

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.080
Hi, you sound excited.

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:18.920
"We have the best animatronics, and food available at the lowest prices."

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:19.620
Oh jeez.

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:21.580
"Straight up guaranteed."

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:22.120
Ah-hah?!

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:26.880
"Since this is your first night at the job, we'll connect you to a live call with our colleague."

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:29.760
Hokay...
"They'll be your guide for the first night."

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:31.020
"Have fun! Bye."

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:32.600
Hokay th... thank you!

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:36.700
Who am I calling? Live call... Oh god, damnit!

00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:38.760
Hi... Why is the...

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:40.540
(Live Call) "Uh, Hello... Hello? Hello?"

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:41.060
Hi!

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:41.840
"Are you there?"

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:42.640
Yea?

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:45.780
"Uh- hi! Uh, you must be the new night guard."

00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:49.900
"Well... uh if that's the case, which it probably is,"

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:54.420
"then I'm supposed to help you with our 'amazing' technology."

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:55.120
OOOoooooh...

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:59.600
"It's a bit... It's a bit cheesy, but you get the point, right?"

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:01.080
No, no, no I eeeoorgh...

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:03.900
"Well, for starters, the company thinks that"

00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:07.560
"putting up security cameras in practically any corner is going to help,"

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:12.180
"and honestly I don't think it will, with what you're gonna have to deal with..."

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:14.380
-boops-
"Uh, but anyway, you can-"

00:01:14.380 --> 00:01:15.540
-boops again-
"switch the security feed-"

00:01:15.540 --> 00:01:19.400
*booping intensifies*
"using the click of our standardized mouse that the company put out.

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:20.260
Okaay...

00:01:20.260 --> 00:01:21.940
"Heh, that's one way to describe it."

00:01:21.940 --> 00:01:22.560
Oh jeez...

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:26.400
"It's reeeeally old, but... uh we'll get through it!"

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:27.600
Ah-huh?

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:28.480
I'm... I-

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:31.860
"But uh, let me tell ya. The power bill gets expensive-"
Jesus!

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:33.480
"With almost every damn night guard."

00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:34.360
What am I looking at?

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:38.100
"So, hopefully by limiting the power, you won't be like them."

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:40.440
By... like who?

00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:44.060
"Unless, you can track the power on the secondary monitor, and for God's sake-"

00:01:44.060 --> 00:01:45.000
*groaning*

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:46.460
"Do nooot break it!"

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:47.200
I do-

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:49.500
"Honestly, I feel like I'm repeating myself at this point."
Ugh!

00:01:49.820 --> 00:01:53.240
"Power is usually measured through the closeable doors in your office,"

00:01:53.240 --> 00:01:56.920
"which can be closed at any time using the Z and X keys."

00:01:57.240 --> 00:02:00.460
"And you'll need to shut them as soon as something-"
*Mark sighs*

00:02:00.460 --> 00:02:03.460
"uh- undesirable may appear."

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:08.540
"Uh, you probably don't know what I mean, which in that case, it's probably-"

00:02:08.540 --> 00:02:09.540
What was that?
"-for the better."

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:13.400
Okaay!
"But, anyway, don't leave them shut."

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:15.940
Hukay!
"Uh, alright! A few more things,"

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:17.660
"and then I can set you on your way!"

00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:20.420
Alright!
"You actually have a spare room next to your office."

00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:21.060
Great!

00:02:21.060 --> 00:02:23.120
"Which has pretty much been deserted for some time."

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:23.660
Coool!

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:28.380
"However, we used to allow employees to go in there, but uh... ah... mmmm..."

00:02:28.720 --> 00:02:30.880
"Kinda had an accident in there."

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:35.140
"Uh... needless to say, don't ever let those curtains-"

00:02:35.140 --> 00:02:36.760
"-open all the way."
Eugh!

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:37.500
Why na-hah-at?

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:42.100
"And if you by chance actually see anything, or anyone back there-"

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:42.860
*spooky laugh*

00:02:42.860 --> 00:02:43.360
Aargh?!

00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:44.680
"Uh, don't go telling-"

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:45.320
Who the fuck...

00:02:45.320 --> 00:02:46.840
"the media. Oookay?"

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:47.500
Aw, shit!

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:51.120
Aw, shit!
"We've had some rough edges in the past-"

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:51.620
Aw shit!

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:53.000
"And probably even more than I've seen myself."

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:53.880
AAH! Shit!

00:02:53.880 --> 00:02:55.120
"But...uh-"
Ah shit ah shit!

00:02:55.120 --> 00:02:56.020
"Long story short-"
Aaaah...

00:02:56.020 --> 00:02:57.880
"always close the curtains."
Fffaaahhhck!

00:02:57.880 --> 00:03:01.580
"Don't ever ask why either, it's just company rule."

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:03.540
Shit, that wasn't the right door!
"Honestly, I-"

00:03:03.540 --> 00:03:05.600
"heh, I don't even know myself."

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:07.660
"You can walk there using the W key.

00:03:08.240 --> 00:03:10.860
"Oh! Um, if an animatronic,"

00:03:10.860 --> 00:03:14.040
"specifically a raccoon and uh..."
Aw what the f, what the fuuuck?

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:16.360
"the thing, from the curtains,"
The TING?!

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:18.940
"find their way into your office-"
Oh god, it's two doors!

00:03:18.940 --> 00:03:19.440
Euw...

00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:20.700
"You can't hide from them."

00:03:21.140 --> 00:03:27.920
"Somehow, they have increased awareness, possibly some sort of uh- developing mistake?"

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:30.720
What?
"Uhhhh, i-it's best not to think about it too much."

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:34.660
"So, uh... yeah! That'll set you on your way-"

00:03:34.660 --> 00:03:35.560
YEAH!
"Close the cur-"

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:37.600
"Oh! Oh oh wait wait wait, one more thing."

00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:38.320
Aaah!

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:44.340
"If two of our 'amazing' animatronics somehow manage to... uh..."

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:46.420
"find their way to BOTH of your doors,"

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:48.960
What the FUUUCK?!
"we found a small trick for that."

00:03:49.180 --> 00:03:55.780
"Hiding under the desk seems to actually help, and even saved my lif- I mean ah, uh, my job."

00:03:55.940 --> 00:03:58.120
Weugh...
"Well, it, uh, helped me save my job one time."

00:03:58.580 --> 00:04:01.860
"So, uh, yeah. Close the curtains, monitor the building,

00:04:01.940 --> 00:04:04.520
Oh God!
"Grab the flashlight, hide under the desk,-"

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:06.560
Uhuh!
"And you'll be promoted as soon as you know it!"

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:10.700
"But actually... please don't hurt yourself."

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:16.480
"We've had some.. issues with our reputation, and it went downhill recently."

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:21.680
"Damn pizzeria down the street. Fazbear's Pizza, or somethin'."

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:27.560
"Somehow it's managed to absolutely DESTROY our reputation"

00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:31.380
"due to them having some sort of... robot incident."

00:04:31.780 --> 00:04:36.220
"Uh, after that discovery, animatronics may just be looked at in a different... way."

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:37.780
"Tch... yea."

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:42.300
"Uh, It's a bit unsanitary and rude, but customers are customers."

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:42.940
Ahuh?

00:04:42.940 --> 00:04:45.320
"We need them, we need their cash."

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:46.200
Oh... What?
*phone clicks*

00:04:46.480 --> 00:04:49.920
(Monotonous phone voice) "Hello and welcome to your new job at Doug's and Rachel's."

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:50.420
WHAT?

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:56.580
"We have the best animatronics and food available at the lowest prices. Straight up guaranteed."

00:04:57.080 --> 00:04:57.640
Wai... er...

00:04:57.640 --> 00:04:59.480
"Since this is your first night at the job-"

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:01.040
Wait weyy wooow woooow

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:03.020
WHAT THA FUCK WAS ALL O' THAAT?

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:05.320
What he FUCK just happened?!

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:07.660
Wai... a... did I miss some here?

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:09.180
(Previous phone caller)"Shit- fuck! God dammit!..."

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:10.400
What the fuck?

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:11.640
"Uh- hello?."

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:12.320
HII!

00:05:12.320 --> 00:05:16.920
"Uh, Hi! Uh welcome back to Doug and Rachel's, and uh... yea..."

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:22.300
"Um, company didn't really want me to record any phone calls after your first night-"

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:24.220
Okaaay... why?
"But I figured, why not?"

00:05:24.580 --> 00:05:29.860
"After all, they don't monitor the calls after the first one, so I'm safe to say what I want! Heh..."

00:05:29.860 --> 00:05:30.500
Ah-hah?

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:33.440
"Well, for starters, which I'm sure you know by now,"

00:05:33.440 --> 00:05:36.480
"the animatronics are REALLY jumpy."

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:41.600
"Uh, easiest way to say it is something like... performing after hours,"

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:43.660
"but with a bit more of a kick."

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:48.100
"They seem to actually move around the building, and no one knows why..."

00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:53.480
"Actually... uh, one of the night guards tried to do some 'investigating' himself,"

00:05:53.480 --> 00:05:56.460
"uh, which probably was the dumbest idea ever."

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:57.480
Yea! Somethin' like that.

00:05:57.480 --> 00:06:02.520
"Poor kid. It's safe to say that it didn't end particularly well. Hah."

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:03.500
HahHAAAHAH!

00:06:03.660 --> 00:06:06.240
"Other than that, nothing really happened recently,"

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:08.680
"although I really shouldn't say that yet..."
Whow! What the fuck is that?

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:12.740
"You're our fourth... er.. fourth- fifth... FIFTH night guard right now,"

00:06:12.740 --> 00:06:16.520
"um... the others being in an unnatural state...

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:18.900
"Hahmm... one of them even stopped talking,"

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:23.300
"and they all have some sort of verbal communication problem... Very strange! Huh!"

00:06:23.880 --> 00:06:27.160
"They had to take him to some therapist, and the family tried suing us!"

00:06:27.840 --> 00:06:31.100
"Cool! Uh, despite all their efforts, of course it didn't work."

00:06:31.100 --> 00:06:31.760
Ah hah!

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:36.720
"Nothing ever does, all it takes is the company's little money before they just wash all the troubles away."

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:37.380
Okay!

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:41.700
"Uh, shouldn't question it, and neither should you for the sake of our job at least."

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:47.320
"As hellish as all this may seem, you'll get through it. Almost all of us do."

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:52.040
Just stop being so subtle about things, yehh... swanky bastard!

00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:53.780
I dunno why these are still closin-

00:06:53.780 --> 00:06:57.820
That was like a million HOURS of conversation that I didn't need to talk about-

00:06:57.820 --> 00:06:59.560
Aah- There's so much information

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:02.500
that they just threw at me, how am I supposed to be able to comprehend all o' it?!

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:06.400
It was all wrapped up in an enigma with bullshit about how I'm gonna DIE!

00:07:07.220 --> 00:07:08.320
WHAT THE FUCK!?

00:07:09.480 --> 00:07:11.620
This is a load of bullsh- HI!

00:07:11.840 --> 00:07:16.260
Who the fuck are you with your green-glowing Outlast-bullshit eyeballs?

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:17.800
*Creepy, deep laugh*
Oh... Aeugh ffuck you!

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:20.480
Whoooooooo the fuck is that?

00:07:20.740 --> 00:07:22.600
Whoa shit, that doesn't sound good.

00:07:22.600 --> 00:07:23.800
Get the FUCK OUTTA HERE!

00:07:23.800 --> 00:07:25.180
And the crontroools!

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:28.840
I don't know the controls yet, why did you put away the controls?

00:07:28.980 --> 00:07:30.140
*Frustrated scream*

00:07:31.360 --> 00:07:32.680
Hokay...

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:34.840
I just needed to get that panic outta my system

00:07:34.840 --> 00:07:38.320
so that I was able to actually comprehend what FUCK was going on here!

00:07:38.320 --> 00:07:43.340
It's already 3 a.m., everything seems to be bullshit and horrible!

00:07:43.780 --> 00:07:45.360
What the fuck!

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:48.380
I... this threw me into the deep end into the pool

00:07:48.380 --> 00:07:53.160
faster than I've ever been thrown in my goddamn life.

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:57.500
You wouldn't like... holy shit. Oh my gawd.

00:07:57.500 --> 00:08:00.280
Okay. So now that I'm done panicking,

00:08:00.280 --> 00:08:03.660
let's actually try to do something about this and close these goddamn curtains,

00:08:03.660 --> 00:08:06.900
whatever the hell is gonna be poppin' outta the goddamn curtains!

00:08:07.280 --> 00:08:09.560
How am I supposed to be able to know ANYTHING?

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:12.740
God, I can't even keep track of what's coming down the hallways!

00:08:13.460 --> 00:08:16.000
Like I don't know... I'm missing one.

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:18.220
One is definitely missing...

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:19.980
One's over there, but there's another one that's mi-

00:08:19.980 --> 00:08:22.120
Eugh. I dunno what's poppin' outta there!

00:08:22.380 --> 00:08:26.260
I had to listen to the phone call for about ten fuckin' minutes!

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:30.340
Which is fine! I get- I get backstory needs to be put out there,

00:08:30.340 --> 00:08:32.820
but I don't remember, like they were tellin' me hints on how to hide

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:36.100
and when to go back and the only thing I remember is 'go back to the goddamn curtains'

00:08:36.420 --> 00:08:39.440
so that I close 'em for SOME FUCKING REASON!

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:43.720
And then go about my goddamn life, which I don't understand fully!

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:45.100
Augh man...

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:52.140
And I get the most snarky boss that ever existed in the world of... Fuckin' animatronic bullshit here.

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:54.980
But I haven't even SEEN a goddamn animatronic!

00:08:55.520 --> 00:09:00.040
They're puttin' it out like I'm gonna die in two goddamn seconds, but nothing has attacked me!

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:02.820
What the fuck- What was that?

00:09:03.300 --> 00:09:04.080
Hello...

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:07.320
But I don't know, one-once it get's further in the nights,

00:09:07.320 --> 00:09:09.520
how am I supposed to be able to get all the way to the back here

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:11.160
and be able to close this bullshit,

00:09:11.160 --> 00:09:12.860
and then go all up all the way to the front?

00:09:13.220 --> 00:09:14.240
Uuh shit, what was that?

00:09:15.420 --> 00:09:15.920
Sorry.

00:09:16.600 --> 00:09:18.400
I'm in a just a bit of a tizzy.

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:20.780
So I'm hopin' that everything's gonna be okay.

00:09:20.880 --> 00:09:23.380
I got power to waste, so I'm pretty sure...

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:25.080
Yea, it's almost six a.m. so...

00:09:25.800 --> 00:09:26.480
Well...

00:09:26.860 --> 00:09:27.820
Alrighty then...

00:09:29.480 --> 00:09:29.980
Hokay...

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:32.760
*Heavy sigh*

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:33.420
Anyway.

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:34.540
G'bye...

00:09:36.640 --> 00:09:37.660
Sooo...

00:09:38.280 --> 00:09:39.400
Just like that!

00:09:39.780 --> 00:09:41.920
I don't know if there was something bugged about the first night

00:09:41.920 --> 00:09:44.620
or just because the phone call went on so long, but it seemed like-

00:09:44.820 --> 00:09:50.160
it seemed like it cut him off when there was vital information, and I'm already on the third night!

00:09:50.160 --> 00:09:51.100
What the hell?!

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:53.880
That doesn't make any sense, there was like no threat yet.

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:55.920
What the hell happened?

00:09:56.360 --> 00:10:00.220
I am so confused. I'm so confused. Oh boy!

00:10:00.220 --> 00:10:05.000
"Don't you think taking the endoskeletons was enough?! wuuwait- oh shit!"

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:06.220
*dial tone*

00:10:06.220 --> 00:10:06.720
What??

00:10:07.760 --> 00:10:09.020
"Uh, hello?"

00:10:09.020 --> 00:10:13.320
"Uh, sorry about that. Just... accidentally picked up at the wrong moment."

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:17.220
"Other than that, uh... welcome back to Rachel's, of course."

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:23.320
"By now, I'm sure you have the hang on things, so there's actually no point of rambling on. Heh."

00:10:23.320 --> 00:10:26.360
'"I'm actually just surprised you've uh, lasted this long."

00:10:26.360 --> 00:10:29.700
"I mean- with your job... uh, yeah!"

00:10:30.140 --> 00:10:31.020
Wait!
"Uh..."

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:33.320
Piggie's gone!
"Uh, anyways,"

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:34.840
"I've heard some news lately-"

00:10:34.840 --> 00:10:36.960
Ah-hah?
"Nothing really interesting of course, you know..."

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:40.460
"Except the fact that the owner is missing... weirdly..."

00:10:40.920 --> 00:10:44.820
"No one has seen him anywhere in the building. A bit strange, don't you think?"

00:10:45.180 --> 00:10:48.060
"Uh, not that I really care, just curiosity. Hmm, y'know."

00:10:48.820 --> 00:10:50.680
"You uh, you wanna know the worst part?"

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:53.780
"We won't get promotions without him being here!"

00:10:54.440 --> 00:10:56.940
"I uh- hopefully, wish he comes back..."

00:10:57.400 --> 00:10:59.720
"For the sake of a promotion at least..."

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:04.480
"It's stupid to think of getting the promotion by now though, interestingly enough."

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:08.920
"Probably due to the fact that the owner doesn't really want to be attached to the company"

00:11:08.920 --> 00:11:11.360
"or the mascots for some reason."

00:11:11.820 --> 00:11:16.140
"Maybe he hates this place for whatever reason, maybe as much as we do? Haha."

00:11:16.140 --> 00:11:17.500
OH GOD, THEY'RE ALL GONE!
"I know I do!"

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:20.200
"In many ways that you'd probably not ever imagine."

00:11:20.980 --> 00:11:23.000
"Uh, this place sure does have a shady past..."

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:26.660
"God, aaaaalright. So I think I'm gonna call it quits now.

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:29.160
"I'll chat with you tomorrow. See ya."
*dial tone*

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:30.660
Yea, if I'm gonna BE here tomorrow!

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:34.360
They're all off the stage and I can't even find 'em on the frickin' camera!

